# Two Angels entering at the same time do not count each other as "Angels you already control" (CR 614.12, 101.4): each is judged
# against the battlefield as it was before the event. Giada stays on the battlefield while Bot1 bolts its own two Inspiring
# Overseers (a 3/2 and a 4/3 by then) on turn 7, and Second Sunrise returns both at once (and Black Lotus, sacrificed for its
# mana): Giada is the only Angel already there, so each Overseer enters with exactly one counter, a 3/2. Bot1 gained 1 life on
# each of the four entries: 24.

